From e798772f581dac08462141e8f9138ae17473b599 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reffehcsoibaf <290818442+reffehcsoibaf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 22:12:01 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: forward the clear-chat app state event

whatsmeow emits events.ClearChat when a chat is cleared on another device
(messages removed, chat kept). Forward it as ChatClearEv (code 54) with the
chat JID, timestamp, FromFullSync, DeleteMedia and the original
ClearChatAction. Registered in neonize/events.py and neonize/aioze/events.py;
the handler only runs when subscribed. Protobuf outputs regenerated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
